><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Did I meet these potatoes before?</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/8/8f/Did_I_meet_these_potatoes_before%3F.png/revision/latest?cb=20221202120300\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Did I meet these potatoes before?\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/8/8f/Did_I_meet_these_potatoes_before%3F.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20221202120300\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/8/8f/Did_I_meet_these_potatoes_before%3F.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20221202120300 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/8/8f/Did_I_meet_these_potatoes_before%3F.png/revision/latest?cb=20221202120300 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Did I meet these potatoes before?\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Did_I_meet_these_potatoes_before%3F.png\" data-image-name=\"Did I meet these potatoes before?.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_14\" title=\"Series 14\">14</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dara_%C3%93_Briain\" title=\"Dara Ó Briain\">Dara Ó Briain</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_new_business_end.\" title=\"A new business end.\">A new business end.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/That%27s_a_swizz.\" title=\"That&#39;s a swizz.\">That's a swizz.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Did I meet these potatoes before?</b></i> is the tenth and final episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_14\" title=\"Series 14\">Series 14</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 1 December 2022. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Dara_%C3%93_Briain\" title=\"Dara Ó Briain\">Dara Ó Briain</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Did_I_meet_these_potatoes_before%3F?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Did I meet these potatoes before?\" was a question posed by <a href=\"/wiki/Fern_Brady\" title=\"Fern Brady\">Fern Brady</a>, during the <a href=\"/wiki/Order_three_things_for_your_final_task\" title=\"Order three things for your final task\">Order three things for your final task</a> task. The title card is of a padlock &amp; key inside a swirly balloon, referencing the <a href=\"/wiki/Land_a_balloon_nearest_the_Taskmaster\" title=\"Land a balloon nearest the Taskmaster\">Land a balloon nearest the Taskmaster</a> task, and the padlock &amp; key references the padlock &amp; key used by in the <a href=\"/wiki/Eat_the_grape\" title=\"Eat the grape\">Eat the grape</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Did_I_meet_these_potatoes_before%3F?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Finalen: Har jeg mødt de her kartofler før?', which translates as 'The finale: Have I met these potatoes before?'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Olenko tavannut nämä perunat aiemmin?', which translates as 'Have I met these potatoes before?'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Har jag träffat potatisarna förut?', which translates as 'Have I met the potatoes before?'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Har jeg møtt disse potetene før?', which translates as 'Have I met these potatoes before?'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Did_I_meet_these_potatoes_before%3F?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Dara_%C3%93_Briain\" title=\"Dara Ó Briain\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Dara Ó Briain</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Fern_Brady\" title=\"Fern Brady\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Fern Brady</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/John_Kearns\" title=\"John Kearns\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">John Kearns</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Munya_Chawawa\" title=\"Munya Chawawa\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Munya Chawawa</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sarah_Millican\" title=\"Sarah Millican\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sarah Millican</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/The_thing_of_yours_that_the_Taskmaster_would_most_like_to_own\" title=\"The thing of yours that the Taskmaster would most like to own\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> The thing of yours that the Taskmaster would most like to own.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>3</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Order_three_things_for_your_final_task\" title=\"Order three things for your final task\">2a</a>\n</td>\n<td>Order three things for your final task. You may spend up to £50.\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Eat_the_grape\" title=\"Eat the grape\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Eat the grape. You must not damage the caravan or climb out the window.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Sculpt_your_team\" title=\"Sculpt your team\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Sculpt your team. Only one person may look at the clay and that person may not touch the clay.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Order_three_things_for_your_final_task\" title=\"Order three things for your final task\">2b</a>\n</td>\n<td>Throw one of your objects over the caravan. Then completely cover one of your items with one of your other items. Then put the covered item on the wooden barrel without touching that item with your hands.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Land_a_balloon_nearest_the_Taskmaster\" title=\"Land a balloon nearest the Taskmaster\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Land a balloon nearest the Taskmaster. You must stay on your spot at all times. If you strike the Taskmaster with a balloon, you're disqualified.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">20\n</td>\n<td>8\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Did_I_meet_these_potatoes_before%3F?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>During the episode's intro, Greg says he will be relieved to not have to think \"Me <a href=\"/wiki/Fern_Brady\" title=\"Fern Brady\">Fern Brady</a>, me Fern Brady\" over and over again anymore, referring to Brady's attempt at the <a href=\"/wiki/Write_a_classic_song\" title=\"Write a classic song\">Write a classic song</a> task.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Did_I_meet_these_potatoes_before%3F?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/did-i-meet-these-potatoes\"><i>Did I meet these potatoes before?</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/70915-010\"><i>Did I meet these potatoes before?</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141519\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: fals